# "Activate only if a player has one or fewer cards in hand": any player, an opponent included. Bot1 holds three cards on
# turn 3 (Swamp, Swamp and its draw) but Bot2 emptied its hand on turn 2 (a land, the Bolts that killed Aclazotz and free
# artifacts, its drawn card included), so the Temple of the Dead can be activated and turns into Aclazotz. The refusal in the previous
# scenario (every hand two or more) is the negative control for the same activation.

